Package: cutefish-toolkit
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: libjxl0.11
Description: Cutefish UI toolkit
 The toolkit every Cutefish application is built with: a Wayland client for
 cutefish-compositor that draws with Skia on GLES, with retained views, text
 layout, controls and frame-paced animation.
